### Upload Asset

Upload new asset to OptiSigns.

**Endpoint:** `POST /optisigns/assets/upload`

**Request:** Multipart form data
- `file` (file): Asset file
- `name` (string): Asset name
- `type` (string): Asset type

**Example using curl:**
```bash
curl -X POST \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
  -F "file=@image.jpg" \
  -F "name=Marketing Image" \
  -F "type=image" \
  https://app.knittt.com/api/optisigns/assets/upload
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "message": "Asset uploaded successfully",
  "asset": {
    "id": "new-uuid",
    "name": "Marketing Image",
    "type": "image",
    "fileType": "jpeg",
    "fileSize": 250000,
    "webLink": "https://cdn.optisigns.com/..."
  },
  "timestamp": "2025-06-23T10:30:00.000Z"
}
```

